### Jira (DBP) — where to look

Stable Jira/API facts for the Enterprise Engineering squad (project key, cloud ID, kickoff policies, branch/slug naming, quirks, workflow snapshot) live in **`.cursor/rules/people/dbp-jira-reference.md`**. Use that file during delivery skills; do not duplicate long tables here.

### Delivery artifact folder (`.cursor/temp/`)

Per-ticket delivery artifacts (PR drafts, planning, SQL tests, Databricks outputs) for People work live under **`.cursor/temp/`** in a subdirectory that **matches the Git branch name exactly** (same string, same `/` nesting).

- Example: branch **`DBP-1268/add-cursor-skills`** → **`.cursor/temp/DBP-1268/add-cursor-skills/`** (not a shortened or flat folder name).
- Resolve from **`git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD`** after the branch exists; e.g. **`PEOPLE/foo-bar`** → **`.cursor/temp/PEOPLE/foo-bar/`**.
- **`.cursor/temp/`** is **gitignored** (not committed).

The **`people-jira-branch-setup`** skill uses this layout; additional People delivery skills under **`.cursor/skills/people-*/`** should reuse the same rule when they land in the repo.

