## DW Layer — SQL (dual-runtime / EMR)

All SQL under `dags/people/**` must run on **Databricks DBR 16.4** and **EMR Spark 3.5** (see `emr_compatibility.mdc` and **`databricks-emr-sql-lint`** skill).

**EMR migration validation** (`databricks-emr-migration`): create/reuse the validation cluster with
instance profile **`emr-people-prod`** (not `emr-prod`). The skill sets this automatically when
`--domain people`.

| Avoid | Prefer |
|-------|--------|
| `QUALIFY` | Ranked CTE with `ROW_NUMBER() … AS rn`, then `WHERE rn = 1` (or join with `AND alias.rn = 1`) |

Apply when deduplicating in DW/enrich/clean People queries — same pattern as `dim_documentation.sql`.

